      "sourceTextSha256": "b5bfcdbdc2b09a4fc6a15f485b712c9be6d3fcae76c77629dbe6b76817cf5fed",
      "text": "After breakfast, you’ll set out at 08:30 on a guided boat trip along the Río Dulce.\n\nLook out for local plants and wildlife as you travel. The calm river runs through tropical forest, and closer to the Caribbean coast the boat enters the Río Dulce canyon. It’s a good stretch for watching wildlife, taking photos and enjoying a leisurely trip on the water.\n\nAfter the cruise, you’ll continue to Flores, the capital of Petén. The drive takes about three hours through scenic countryside, with a stop for lunch along the way.\n\nYou’ll arrive in Flores in the afternoon and spend the night at Hotel Racoon del Lago.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-e805e5042bc7",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      }
